(3004660, 422670, 25793, '<td valign="top">Nice Image.  I think it could be stronger if you used a Split Neutral Density filter to decrease the exposure at the top and increase your exposure at the bottom.</td>', 'Nice Image.  I think it could be stronger if you used a Split Neutral Density filter to decrease the exposure at the top and increase your exposure at the bottom.', '2006-11-06 01:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004664, 423215, 25793, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  I love the way the falls lead the eye through the image.</td>', 'Very nice image.  I love the way the falls lead the eye through the image.', '2006-11-06 01:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004671, 423279, 62637, '<td valign="top">the sharpness of this photo suffers with the long shutter speed, especially in the pile of debris on the left.</td>', 'the sharpness of this photo suffers with the long shutter speed, especially in the pile of debris on the left.', '2006-11-06 01:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004675, 423184, 37858, '<td valign="top">This looks like it was shot on another planet.  Love the colors.</td>', 'This looks like it was shot on another planet.  Love the colors.', '2006-11-06 01:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004676, 420571, 25793, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  I love the lighting here.  The orange color reflecting in the clouds is a nice touch.  I think the image could have been stronger if you could have moved closer to the edge of the cliff.  But you may not have been able to do so.  Good job though!</td>', 'Very nice image.  I love the lighting here.  The orange color reflecting in the clouds is a nice touch.  I think the image could have been stronger if you could have moved closer to the edge of the cliff.  But you may not have been able to do so.  Good job though!', '2006-11-06 01:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004678, 422472, 37858, '<td valign="top">The colors in the reflection are beautiful.  This has such a peaceful look about it.  Well done.</td>', 'The colors in the reflection are beautiful.  This has such a peaceful look about it.  Well done.', '2006-11-06 01:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004679, 423108, 25793, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  I love night photography.  I love the transparent effect of the person on the wagon.  I think this image could have been stronger with an exposure that lasted a couple of minutes to get some movement in the stars.  But you did a great job!</td>', 'Very nice image.  I love night photography.  I love the transparent effect of the person on the wagon.  I think this image could have been stronger with an exposure that lasted a couple of minutes to get some movement in the stars.  But you did a great job!', '2006-11-06 01:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004681, 420929, 37858, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred a less severe crop.  Even the pages are partially cropped.</td>', 'I would have preferred a less severe crop.  Even the pages are partially cropped.', '2006-11-06 01:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004687, 423324, 25793, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image!  I love how the traffic leads my eye into your image and then right across the bridge.  Very well executed!</td>', 'Fantastic image!  I love how the traffic leads my eye into your image and then right across the bridge.  Very well executed!', '2006-11-06 01:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004688, 421643, 25793, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I love images of star trails.</td>', 'Very nice.  I love images of star trails.', '2006-11-06 01:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004691, 423148, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like the inclusion of the people and trees.  It gives scale and interest to the image.</td>', 'I like the inclusion of the people and trees.  It gives scale and interest to the image.', '2006-11-06 01:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004693, 419539, 25793, '<td valign="top">I like the graphic element of this image.</td>', 'I like the graphic element of this image.', '2006-11-06 01:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004696, 423246, 62637, '<td valign="top">i dont see how this image is a product of a long shutter speed.  maybe it is, but theres nothing other than some EXIF data to show that</td>', 'i dont see how this image is a product of a long shutter speed.  maybe it is, but theres nothing other than some EXIF data to show that', '2006-11-06 01:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004697, 421809, 37858, '<td valign="top">The composition is interesting.  I like the wet stones.</td>', 'The composition is interesting.  I like the wet stones.', '2006-11-06 01:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004699, 423359, 37858, '<td valign="top">The hotel lights are a bit out of focus, which is a shame.</td>', 'The hotel lights are a bit out of focus, which is a shame.', '2006-11-06 01:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004701, 423169, 25793, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  You have captured one of my favorite water effects. Nice usage of a graduated neutral density filter.  I love how the rocks in the foreground anchor the image.</td>', 'Very nice image.  You have captured one of my favorite water effects. Nice usage of a graduated neutral density filter.  I love how the rocks in the foreground anchor the image.', '2006-11-06 01:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004702, 421643, 62637, '<td valign="top">blue ribbon, right here.</td>', 'blue ribbon, right here.', '2006-11-06 01:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004704, 423085, 25793, '<td valign="top">Nice Light.</td>', 'Nice Light.', '2006-11-06 02:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004708, 423143, 25793, '<td valign="top">Very nice job with the painting of light.  I like how you were able to fill the frame.</td>', 'Very nice job with the painting of light.  I like how you were able to fill the frame.', '2006-11-06 02:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004709, 421699, 62637, '<td valign="top">original thinking!</td>', 'original thinking!', '2006-11-06 02:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004711, 423297, 25793, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  I think the image could be stronger with a change in white balance.  But that is just my taste.  You may prefer the cooler tone here.  Over all nice job.</td>', 'Nice image.  I think the image could be stronger with a change in white balance.  But that is just my taste.  You may prefer the cooler tone here.  Over all nice job.', '2006-11-06 02:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004713, 423300, 37858, '<td valign="top">Very nice work.  I love the colors and the clarity of this image.</td>', 'Very nice work.  I love the colors and the clarity of this image.', '2006-11-06 02:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004714, 421505, 25793, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective taken on the light house.  I like the light beam effect.</td>', 'Nice perspective taken on the light house.  I like the light beam effect.', '2006-11-06 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004717, 422686, 62637, '<td valign="top">poor image quality</td>', 'poor image quality', '2006-11-06 02:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004718, 422066, 25793, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  I feel it could have been stronger had you placed the structure into the top third of the frame and let the  reflections of light across the water add a more graphical element to the image.  Nicely executed.</td>', 'Nice image.  I feel it could have been stronger had you placed the structure into the top third of the frame and let the  reflections of light across the water add a more graphical element to the image.  Nicely executed.', '2006-11-06 02:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004719, 421663, 62637, '<td valign="top">WOW</td>', 'WOW', '2006-11-06 02:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004720, 419539, 37858, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and lighting.</td>', 'Interesting composition and lighting.', '2006-11-06 02:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004722, 422278, 25793, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  I like the falls at the bottom half of the frame.  I think this image could have been stronger if you moved your camer to the right and shot to the left.  You may have been able to get the hand rails out of the image.  I find them just a bit distracting.  The use of a polarizer would have helped to lift the white glare out of the image as well and helped to puch up the color.  Great composition and very well executed.</td>', 'Nice image.  I like the falls at the bottom half of the frame.  I think this image could have been stronger if you moved your camer to the right and shot to the left.  You may have been able to get the hand rails out of the image.  I find them just a bit distracting.  The use of a polarizer would have helped to lift the white glare out of the image as well and helped to puch up the color.  Great composition and very well executed.', '2006-11-06 02:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004728, 423382, 62637, '<td valign="top">its just squiggles</td>', 'its just squiggles', '2006-11-06 02:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004735, 423393, 25793, '<td valign="top">Nice attempt at panning!  This is not an easy thing to do.  You managed to keep the head and feet sharp.  Very well executed.  I think a larger aperture would have helped with the background.</td>', 'Nice attempt at panning!  This is not an easy thing to do.  You managed to keep the head and feet sharp.  Very well executed.  I think a larger aperture would have helped with the background.', '2006-11-06 02:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004740, 423172, 25793, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones!  I think the use of a split neutral density filter could have been used to make this image stronger.  It would have helped to increase your exposure on the foreground.</td>', 'Very nice tones!  I think the use of a split neutral density filter could have been used to make this image stronger.  It would have helped to increase your exposure on the foreground.', '2006-11-06 02:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004745, 422972, 62637, '<td valign="top">theres nothing really of interest here...where are all those sparks coming from?</td>', 'theres nothing really of interest here...where are all those sparks coming from?', '2006-11-06 02:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3004751, 422548, 25793, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors!  Exposure is dead on.  I think this image could have been stronger if you had moved to your left about 10 or 15 feet and turned the camera your right and down to allow the line of the bridge to emerge from the upper right corner of the frame.  This would have helped to fill in some of the negative space to the left of the building.  Very well executed.</td>', 'Very nice colors!  Exposure is dead on.  I think this image could have been stronger if you had moved to your left about 10 or 15 feet and turned the camera your right and down to allow the line of the bridge to emerge from the upper right corner of the frame.  This would have helped to fill in some of the negative space to the left of the building.  Very well executed.', '2006-11-06 02:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
