(3006268, 422785, 23484, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t like these type of shots but this was done very well. 8</td>', 'I usually don''t like these type of shots but this was done very well. 8', '2006-11-06 13:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006271, 420169, 23484, '<td valign="top">Makes me dizzy just looking at it. 7</td>', 'Makes me dizzy just looking at it. 7', '2006-11-06 13:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006289, 422472, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very well done. 9</td>', 'Very well done. 9', '2006-11-06 13:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006329, 423259, 67257, '<td valign="top">What a coincidence  I was just there taking pictures for the neon challenge.  I like the pictures.</td>', 'What a coincidence  I was just there taking pictures for the neon challenge.  I like the pictures.', '2006-11-06 13:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006333, 423027, 67257, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  I like how the lights from the road almost blend with the colors in the sky.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  I like how the lights from the road almost blend with the colors in the sky.', '2006-11-06 13:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006367, 422472, 67257, '<td valign="top">Wow this is great picture.  I like the reflection in the water, the fade of bright to dark in the sky, and location from where you took the picture.</td>', 'Wow this is great picture.  I like the reflection in the water, the fade of bright to dark in the sky, and location from where you took the picture.', '2006-11-06 13:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006385, 421699, 67257, '<td valign="top">The effect is great.  The picture is a little wasted out on the right hand side however.  Almost a ten.</td>', 'The effect is great.  The picture is a little wasted out on the right hand side however.  Almost a ten.', '2006-11-06 13:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006396, 423300, 67257, '<td valign="top">Only a brave person stands in Camden at night to take a picture of Philadelphia.  You get points for that alone.  I have never seen a picture of Philadelphia from that angle.  I love it.  The reflection looks great.</td>', 'Only a brave person stands in Camden at night to take a picture of Philadelphia.  You get points for that alone.  I have never seen a picture of Philadelphia from that angle.  I love it.  The reflection looks great.', '2006-11-06 13:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006435, 423360, 3102, '<td valign="top">A neat shot with a great sky... but I''m not sure it''s a good representation of the challenge.  It would seem since you captured a wave in mid-splash that this would be a pretty fast shutter speed.</td>', 'A neat shot with a great sky... but I''m not sure it''s a good representation of the challenge.  It would seem since you captured a wave in mid-splash that this would be a pretty fast shutter speed.', '2006-11-06 13:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006436, 422186, 3102, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem like it would have been a long exposure -- otherwise the kites (assuming they''re kites) would have been in motion and the water wouldn''t have been captured so still.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem like it would have been a long exposure -- otherwise the kites (assuming they''re kites) would have been in motion and the water wouldn''t have been captured so still.', '2006-11-06 13:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006438, 421766, 67257, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Max Headroom.</td>', 'Reminds me of Max Headroom.', '2006-11-06 13:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006441, 421711, 29293, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2006-11-06 13:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006445, 421771, 3102, '<td valign="top">If this isn''t a ribbon winner, I shall eat my own foot.</td>', 'If this isn''t a ribbon winner, I shall eat my own foot.', '2006-11-06 13:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006451, 423259, 23484, '<td valign="top">Good shot but I think it should have been cropped a little more. 6</td>', 'Good shot but I think it should have been cropped a little more. 6', '2006-11-06 13:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006462, 423416, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very interesting concept and photograph. Fits the challenge topic exceptionally well. Technical quality is OK and soft background works.<br/> <br/>The guy above and to the left of her head is a distraction. Because he is holding something unidentifiable viewers are attracted away from your main subject to speculate what that might be. Plus he looks like he is sticking out of her head. It is hard to put a finger on it but your model''s pose is a little off. Her facial expression is fine for your intent; I think her her posture is wrong. She is very attractive but her slump distracts from her beauty and the quality of this fine image.</td>', 'Very interesting concept and photograph. Fits the challenge topic exceptionally well. Technical quality is OK and soft background works. The guy above and to the left of her head is a distraction. Because he is holding something unidentifiable viewers are attracted away from your main subject to speculate what that might be. Plus he looks like he is sticking out of her head. It is hard to put a finger on it but your model''s pose is a little off. Her facial expression is fine for your intent; I think her her posture is wrong. She is very attractive but her slump distracts from her beauty and the quality of this fine image.', '2006-11-06 13:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006474, 423053, 55956, '<td valign="top">beatiful!</td>', 'beatiful!', '2006-11-06 13:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006498, 423259, 3102, '<td valign="top">I had the pleasure of enjoying a cheesesteak there this summer -- and it was definitely the best I''ve ever had!  I''ll have to try Pat''s next time.</td>', 'I had the pleasure of enjoying a cheesesteak there this summer -- and it was definitely the best I''ve ever had!  I''ll have to try Pat''s next time.', '2006-11-06 14:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006517, 423414, 3102, '<td valign="top">I probably would have cloned out the plane in the middle of the bridge, but I never get tired of seeing shots like this!</td>', 'I probably would have cloned out the plane in the middle of the bridge, but I never get tired of seeing shots like this!', '2006-11-06 14:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006547, 423110, 55956, '<td valign="top">very good the composition,great the colours,good the idea. 10</td>', 'very good the composition,great the colours,good the idea. 10', '2006-11-06 14:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006557, 423207, 14476, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and colors.  Slightly marred (IMO) by the lettering on the glass candleholder.  Advanced editing would let you take that out...<br/>Nevertheless, a wonderful image.</td>', 'Lovely composition and colors.  Slightly marred (IMO) by the lettering on the glass candleholder.  Advanced editing would let you take that out...Nevertheless, a wonderful image.', '2006-11-06 14:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006562, 423400, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, LIKE the feet!</td>', 'Oh, LIKE the feet!', '2006-11-06 14:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006563, 423166, 15032, '<td valign="top">I like the gold/purple contrast</td>', 'I like the gold/purple contrast', '2006-11-06 14:23:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3006568, 423117, 15032, '<td valign="top">Great shutter lenght to keep the motion of the water but not let it get too blurred.  There is a bit of overexposure in the middle, but overall well done</td>', 'Great shutter lenght to keep the motion of the water but not let it get too blurred.  There is a bit of overexposure in the middle, but overall well done', '2006-11-06 14:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006575, 423380, 15032, '<td valign="top">Maybe I am missing something, but I am not sure how this fits into long exposure</td>', 'Maybe I am missing something, but I am not sure how this fits into long exposure', '2006-11-06 14:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006607, 420439, 66193, '<td valign="top">love this one</td>', 'love this one', '2006-11-06 14:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006615, 423418, 66193, '<td valign="top">love the star pattern from the light</td>', 'love the star pattern from the light', '2006-11-06 14:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006634, 422654, 5792, '<td valign="top">A very nice bridge picture and the color works. Though it will make the bridge look more tilted you might consider making the river horizontally level. Viewers will associate that more with a level horizon than the bridge. Though this is probably a timed exposure shot the river shows it to be quit short and there is little evidence of the passage of time. DNMCers will fault you for this.</td>', 'A very nice bridge picture and the color works. Though it will make the bridge look more tilted you might consider making the river horizontally level. Viewers will associate that more with a level horizon than the bridge. Though this is probably a timed exposure shot the river shows it to be quit short and there is little evidence of the passage of time. DNMCers will fault you for this.', '2006-11-06 14:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006661, 422123, 5792, '<td valign="top">Classic long exposure cityscape. Amazing how many people take night shots but fail to include an sense of the passage of time for a challenge like this. The is perfectly executed and technically superior and will finish high in the challenge.</td>', 'Classic long exposure cityscape. Amazing how many people take night shots but fail to include an sense of the passage of time for a challenge like this. The is perfectly executed and technically superior and will finish high in the challenge.', '2006-11-06 15:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
