(3006861, 423434, 39427, '<td valign="top">I''m always a fan of the non-traditional photos, i''m afraid they aren''t always well received on this site.  Anyways, cool shot, I''m thinking you may have had a more dynamic image if there was a person in the window...</td>', 'I''m always a fan of the non-traditional photos, i''m afraid they aren''t always well received on this site.  Anyways, cool shot, I''m thinking you may have had a more dynamic image if there was a person in the window...', '2006-11-06 15:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006873, 422699, 39427, '<td valign="top">yes, i love the abstractness, I actually have a semi-similar photo in concept from the Time challenge, nice job.</td>', 'yes, i love the abstractness, I actually have a semi-similar photo in concept from the Time challenge, nice job.', '2006-11-06 15:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006878, 422659, 5792, '<td valign="top">There is too much uninteresting detail in the foreground and sky, the crop and perspective are nothing special, the trucks are ordinary and not well lighted or positioned, the street lacks interest, the purple of the store is over the top color, etc, etc... there are any number of reasons this should be considered a lousy photograph... but...<br/> <br/>Your processing of and inclusion of lighting and color in this composition is pure genius. The way you''ve made the hangout building bright white to stand out is amazing. Even the purple color adds mysterious attraction for the locals in the mind of this reviewer. The yellow lighting from the streetlight on the road adds much. The way you''ve processed the illumination on the trees is incredible. The sharpness of the building and trees is perfect.</td>', 'There is too much uninteresting detail in the foreground and sky, the crop and perspective are nothing special, the trucks are ordinary and not well lighted or positioned, the street lacks interest, the purple of the store is over the top color, etc, etc... there are any number of reasons this should be considered a lousy photograph... but... Your processing of and inclusion of lighting and color in this composition is pure genius. The way you''ve made the hangout building bright white to stand out is amazing. Even the purple color adds mysterious attraction for the locals in the mind of this reviewer. The yellow lighting from the streetlight on the road adds much. The way you''ve processed the illumination on the trees is incredible. The sharpness of the building and trees is perfect.', '2006-11-06 15:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
