(3007439, 423246, 64175, '<td valign="top">Let me say that I really like the subject matter and the overall composition. I don''t count off for borders and normally this thick white border would not be my favorite, but it works very well here.  The one thing though that I really have an issue with is the challenge criteria.  I''m don''t really feel that a long shutter speed here really performed what I consider a "dramatic effect".  <br/> <br/>It is such a nice image though and it defintely does not fall into the DNMC bucket.  So, I''d give it a 5.<br/> <br/>Details: Long exposures can often create very dramatic effects in photography. Use a longer than normal exposure to create the impact of your image.</td>', 'Let me say that I really like the subject matter and the overall composition. I don''t count off for borders and normally this thick white border would not be my favorite, but it works very well here.  The one thing though that I really have an issue with is the challenge criteria.  I''m don''t really feel that a long shutter speed here really performed what I consider a "dramatic effect".   It is such a nice image though and it defintely does not fall into the DNMC bucket.  So, I''d give it a 5. Details: Long exposures can often create very dramatic effects in photography. Use a longer than normal exposure to create the impact of your image.', '2006-11-06 17:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
