(3009861, 423254, 64175, '<td valign="top">Very, very, cool.  This one has a "how''d they do that" written all over it. I''m pretty sure I know about the light, but I''m curious about the planet. It kind of looks like a melon.  10.</td>', 'Very, very, cool.  This one has a "how''d they do that" written all over it. I''m pretty sure I know about the light, but I''m curious about the planet. It kind of looks like a melon.  10.', '2006-11-07 09:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3009863, 420571, 15032, '<td valign="top">A great spot to take photos.  I think a vantage point from a bit further up would have been better so that the bridge is not cut off and so you can''t see the fence</td>', 'A great spot to take photos.  I think a vantage point from a bit further up would have been better so that the bridge is not cut off and so you can''t see the fence', '2006-11-07 09:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
