(3009869, 423414, 15032, '<td valign="top">Nice photo and great vantage point.  My only suggestions would have been to wait for the plane to pass so you don''t have a white streak in the sky, and to wait for a day when the stadius is not being used at night so you don''t see the light on the horizon from that.  But overall, a very nice shot.</td>', 'Nice photo and great vantage point.  My only suggestions would have been to wait for the plane to pass so you don''t have a white streak in the sky, and to wait for a day when the stadius is not being used at night so you don''t see the light on the horizon from that.  But overall, a very nice shot.', '2006-11-07 09:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
