(3015301, 422788, 24073, '<td valign="top">Great artistic vision, and well executed.  I don''t know how well it will fair among the other voters, but you certainly have my vote.  Well done.  GL.</td>', 'Great artistic vision, and well executed.  I don''t know how well it will fair among the other voters, but you certainly have my vote.  Well done.  GL.', '2006-11-08 16:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
