(3017220, 423294, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty without being excessively ethereal. 9.</td>', 'Pretty without being excessively ethereal. 9.', '2006-11-09 09:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017221, 422760, 51538, '<td valign="top">One of the best in this challenge, IMO.  A winner in my book. 9.</td>', 'One of the best in this challenge, IMO.  A winner in my book. 9.', '2006-11-09 09:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017224, 423430, 51538, '<td valign="top">Outstanding for the location and the composition, whether set up or not, is excellent. 10.</td>', 'Outstanding for the location and the composition, whether set up or not, is excellent. 10.', '2006-11-09 09:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017225, 422536, 51538, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites from this challenge.  I like the exciting moment and the contrast. 10.</td>', 'One of my favourites from this challenge.  I like the exciting moment and the contrast. 10.', '2006-11-09 09:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017227, 423197, 51538, '<td valign="top">Simple but very satisfying. 9.</td>', 'Simple but very satisfying. 9.', '2006-11-09 09:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017228, 423117, 51538, '<td valign="top">I''m not a huge fan of waterfall photos - but yours overcomes my aversion. 8.</td>', 'I''m not a huge fan of waterfall photos - but yours overcomes my aversion. 8.', '2006-11-09 09:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017230, 423250, 51538, '<td valign="top">Simple and expressive.  8.</td>', 'Simple and expressive.  8.', '2006-11-09 09:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017231, 422123, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely dynamic in expression. 8.</td>', 'Nicely dynamic in expression. 8.', '2006-11-09 09:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017233, 422006, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very clean and nice hint at the timing with the star trails. 8.</td>', 'Very clean and nice hint at the timing with the star trails. 8.', '2006-11-09 09:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017235, 423027, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, expressive but still subtle. 9.</td>', 'Nice perspective, expressive but still subtle. 9.', '2006-11-09 09:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017237, 421390, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured.  The light feeling in the image is pleasant. 8.</td>', 'Nicely captured.  The light feeling in the image is pleasant. 8.', '2006-11-09 09:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017295, 422677, 66834, '<td valign="top">I did a double-take when I saw this photo.  Creepy and I can''t stop looking at it.</td>', 'I did a double-take when I saw this photo.  Creepy and I can''t stop looking at it.', '2006-11-09 10:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017300, 423372, 66834, '<td valign="top">How did you do this?  It reminds me of the iPod commercial.</td>', 'How did you do this?  It reminds me of the iPod commercial.', '2006-11-09 10:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017342, 423271, 27399, '<td valign="top">Good framing, great range of tones, and intelligent title.  Overall great image.</td>', 'Good framing, great range of tones, and intelligent title.  Overall great image.', '2006-11-09 10:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017348, 423184, 27399, '<td valign="top">Impressive image.  Almost looks surreal.  It looks as though you lost some clarity during resizing, and I would like to have seen more detail in the right corner foreground.  Great range of colors, light, and you really capture a sense of time in this photo.</td>', 'Impressive image.  Almost looks surreal.  It looks as though you lost some clarity during resizing, and I would like to have seen more detail in the right corner foreground.  Great range of colors, light, and you really capture a sense of time in this photo.', '2006-11-09 10:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017351, 421624, 27399, '<td valign="top">Anyone who has worked with long exposures with the detail of the subject having to interact with the background can appreciate the brilliant framing in this image.  The black night sky allowing for detail in the face, with the light on the lighter color jacket allowing the light to be reflected and recorded while the shadows and dark clothing fade into the surrounding environment.  Great job! 10.</td>', 'Anyone who has worked with long exposures with the detail of the subject having to interact with the background can appreciate the brilliant framing in this image.  The black night sky allowing for detail in the face, with the light on the lighter color jacket allowing the light to be reflected and recorded while the shadows and dark clothing fade into the surrounding environment.  Great job! 10.', '2006-11-09 10:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017354, 423250, 27399, '<td valign="top">A great photo is one that first evokes a reaction/feeling from the viewer as soon as they see it.  Afterwards comes the closer look and better understanding of the image.  While simple, this photo does evoke reaction/feeling (smile/pleasure) and is a technically solid.  Having the subject all black/sillhoutted under the umbrella and/or enhancing the color/saturation of the blue in the sky could add to the image.  Overall, really good and deserves a high score.</td>', 'A great photo is one that first evokes a reaction/feeling from the viewer as soon as they see it.  Afterwards comes the closer look and better understanding of the image.  While simple, this photo does evoke reaction/feeling (smile/pleasure) and is a technically solid.  Having the subject all black/sillhoutted under the umbrella and/or enhancing the color/saturation of the blue in the sky could add to the image.  Overall, really good and deserves a high score.', '2006-11-09 10:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017355, 422699, 27399, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea!  Nice framing (both starting and ending positions) and perfect, clear zoom.  Exposure is perfect, and good decision to make this black and white.  Please make a print of this!  I am adding it to my favorites.</td>', 'Brilliant idea!  Nice framing (both starting and ending positions) and perfect, clear zoom.  Exposure is perfect, and good decision to make this black and white.  Please make a print of this!  I am adding it to my favorites.', '2006-11-09 11:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017358, 423225, 27399, '<td valign="top">This photo is probably going to be hit and miss with a lot of people: for me, its a hit.  The subject, lighting, framing, and courage to use long exposure to affect the entire image instead of select elements of the image all add to the quality of the photo.  Great work.  10.</td>', 'This photo is probably going to be hit and miss with a lot of people: for me, its a hit.  The subject, lighting, framing, and courage to use long exposure to affect the entire image instead of select elements of the image all add to the quality of the photo.  Great work.  10.', '2006-11-09 11:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017362, 423197, 27399, '<td valign="top">Good colors and framing, and subject.</td>', 'Good colors and framing, and subject.', '2006-11-09 11:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017373, 420439, 27399, '<td valign="top">I looked, but I could not find the old lady in the chair, the mouse, or any of the other things listed in the book :)  Great image, very soft feel to this image.  What really makes the photo, in my opinion, is the tail on the moon, giving the impression that you are watching something streak through the sky.  One of my top photos in this challenge, good work.</td>', 'I looked, but I could not find the old lady in the chair, the mouse, or any of the other things listed in the book :)  Great image, very soft feel to this image.  What really makes the photo, in my opinion, is the tail on the moon, giving the impression that you are watching something streak through the sky.  One of my top photos in this challenge, good work.', '2006-11-09 11:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017703, 423108, 39057, '<td valign="top">My brain cries for this to be straight !</td>', 'My brain cries for this to be straight !', '2006-11-09 13:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017746, 422533, 32345, '<td valign="top">An expensive picture to take... :)<br/> <br/>Very good message.</td>', 'An expensive picture to take... :) Very good message.', '2006-11-09 13:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017825, 423416, 22781, '<td valign="top">5</td>', '5', '2006-11-09 14:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017839, 422006, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very surreal looking photograph.  This has the feel of an airbrush painting.  Beautiful, good luck!</td>', 'Very surreal looking photograph.  This has the feel of an airbrush painting.  Beautiful, good luck!', '2006-11-09 14:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017841, 421390, 42100, '<td valign="top">Stunner...very out of this world.  Excellent composition and exposure.  Well done!</td>', 'Stunner...very out of this world.  Excellent composition and exposure.  Well done!', '2006-11-09 14:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017844, 421705, 42100, '<td valign="top">Elegant and amazing!  Perfect technicals and a wonderful composition.  Excellent!</td>', 'Elegant and amazing!  Perfect technicals and a wonderful composition.  Excellent!', '2006-11-09 14:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
