(3017922, 423262, 42100, '<td valign="top">Most excellent compsition to this.  The prefect color and exposure doesn''t hurt either.  Excellent!</td>', 'Most excellent compsition to this.  The prefect color and exposure doesn''t hurt either.  Excellent!', '2006-11-09 14:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017926, 422274, 67301, '<td valign="top">I like this shot because it has good focus and fantastic reflection the colours suit the image, but maybe a little too strong</td>', 'I like this shot because it has good focus and fantastic reflection the colours suit the image, but maybe a little too strong', '2006-11-09 14:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017938, 420943, 67301, '<td valign="top">this is a well focused shot but I think that there is too much going on</td>', 'this is a well focused shot but I think that there is too much going on', '2006-11-09 14:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017940, 423383, 66193, '<td valign="top">cool use of the colored lights</td>', 'cool use of the colored lights', '2006-11-09 14:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017946, 423271, 42100, '<td valign="top">Stunning photograph.  Great b&amp;w conversion, really looks great this way.  Well done!</td>', 'Stunning photograph.  Great b&w conversion, really looks great this way.  Well done!', '2006-11-09 14:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017951, 423163, 42100, '<td valign="top">Love the motion you''ve captured in this and the way you captured it!  Composition is excellent as well.  Definitely bumping this one, great job!</td>', 'Love the motion you''ve captured in this and the way you captured it!  Composition is excellent as well.  Definitely bumping this one, great job!', '2006-11-09 14:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017953, 421740, 66193, '<td valign="top">hopefully constructive comments: try to avoid lighting that gives obvious shadows, unless that shadow will complement subject.  also, try a more interesting composition, where the subject is not smack dab in the middle of the frame.  And finally, find a more interesting subject.  You can get more creative and find something more interesting to roll.</td>', 'hopefully constructive comments: try to avoid lighting that gives obvious shadows, unless that shadow will complement subject.  also, try a more interesting composition, where the subject is not smack dab in the middle of the frame.  And finally, find a more interesting subject.  You can get more creative and find something more interesting to roll.', '2006-11-09 14:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017955, 421643, 66193, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for star trails</td>', 'I''m a sucker for star trails', '2006-11-09 14:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017956, 423166, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very surreal, looks like this could be right out of a sci-fi movie.  Great color and great job!</td>', 'Very surreal, looks like this could be right out of a sci-fi movie.  Great color and great job!', '2006-11-09 14:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017961, 423256, 66193, '<td valign="top">now that''s a fat cat!  Looks like my cat.</td>', 'now that''s a fat cat!  Looks like my cat.', '2006-11-09 14:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017963, 421139, 66193, '<td valign="top">very nice colors</td>', 'very nice colors', '2006-11-09 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017965, 423294, 42100, '<td valign="top">I never tire of these types of photos with the blurred waves, especially when done as well as this.  Very nice!</td>', 'I never tire of these types of photos with the blurred waves, especially when done as well as this.  Very nice!', '2006-11-09 14:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017967, 423254, 66193, '<td valign="top">I had to spend a little more time on this one (you can say it got longer exposure!).  Very interesting composition, and it certainly grabs your attention.  well done</td>', 'I had to spend a little more time on this one (you can say it got longer exposure!).  Very interesting composition, and it certainly grabs your attention.  well done', '2006-11-09 14:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
