(3018702, 422728, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great sky!  I could chop of the ground and enjoy that sky for some time.  So much depth to it.   Very cool Beau!</td>', 'Great sky!  I could chop of the ground and enjoy that sky for some time.  So much depth to it.   Very cool Beau!', '2006-11-09 20:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3018914, 422718, 61818, '<td valign="top">Cool looking shot.  Would have more impact if it was cropped tighter around the guy and his magic.  Good luck.</td>', 'Cool looking shot.  Would have more impact if it was cropped tighter around the guy and his magic.  Good luck.', '2006-11-09 21:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3019132, 422123, 2333, '<td valign="top"><strike>Testing, Testing, 1,2,3, testing...</strike> <br/> <br/>OK, time to enter a real comment! <br/>I really like the symmetry of the roadway. The Roadway also provides a great leading line to the skyline. My eye naturally follows the skyline from left to right, and returns to lower right via the wall. The asymmetry of the left and right trees help this flow. The placement of the skyline along the upper thirds line is perfect, IMO.<br/>The deep blue sky is stunning, and really makes this, IMO. I also think you got the sharpening perfect. It would have been very easy to oversharpen this.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-09 22:12:37.</i></td>', 'Testing, Testing, 1,2,3, testing...  OK, time to enter a real comment! I really like the symmetry of the roadway. The Roadway also provides a great leading line to the skyline. My eye naturally follows the skyline from left to right, and returns to lower right via the wall. The asymmetry of the left and right trees help this flow. The placement of the skyline along the upper thirds line is perfect, IMO.The deep blue sky is stunning, and really makes this, IMO. I also think you got the sharpening perfect. It would have been very easy to oversharpen this.', '2006-11-09 23:40:49.000000', '2006-11-09 22:12:37.000000', 1),
(3019318, 423146, 62187, '<td valign="top">I want to believe it''s just one flower slowly sinking in a glass of water. I''m not sure but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt. (If others have had similar comments, maybe a singular title of ''Purple Petal'' might have cleared it up?) I''ll give it a 7.</td>', 'I want to believe it''s just one flower slowly sinking in a glass of water. I''m not sure but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt. (If others have had similar comments, maybe a singular title of ''Purple Petal'' might have cleared it up?) I''ll give it a 7.', '2006-11-10 02:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3019321, 423329, 62187, '<td valign="top">Do you know what constellation you''ve captured? Just in case, it''s Canis Major or, the Big Dog (Some people say Greater Dog). The brightest star is Sirius, the brightest star in our night sky. Very nice photo, I really like it. 9 - because you gave it a stupid name - just kidding! };&gt;) ok, 10.</td>', 'Do you know what constellation you''ve captured? Just in case, it''s Canis Major or, the Big Dog (Some people say Greater Dog). The brightest star is Sirius, the brightest star in our night sky. Very nice photo, I really like it. 9 - because you gave it a stupid name - just kidding! };>) ok, 10.', '2006-11-10 02:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
