(3019580, 423110, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is a really creative take on the spinning umbrella idea - really lends itself to wonder what''s going on behind the umbrella!  Unfortunately, the umbrella is a little too bright and saturated, I think.  The real impact of the shot comes from the viewer peeking into a private moment, not the umbrella spinning.  I also don''t see the need for all the negative space on the right side of the frame, it adds nothing to the shot.  A closer crop will increase the intimate feel of the shot, which I believe is what you were going for to begin with.  Overall this is a great shot, so it gets a great score!  :)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a really creative take on the spinning umbrella idea - really lends itself to wonder what''s going on behind the umbrella!  Unfortunately, the umbrella is a little too bright and saturated, I think.  The real impact of the shot comes from the viewer peeking into a private moment, not the umbrella spinning.  I also don''t see the need for all the negative space on the right side of the frame, it adds nothing to the shot.  A closer crop will increase the intimate feel of the shot, which I believe is what you were going for to begin with.  Overall this is a great shot, so it gets a great score!  :)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-10 08:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
