(3019584, 420169, 29009, '<td valign="top">Huge impact shot here.  The sense of motion through the frame is really well done!  I''m looking at it and feeling like <i>I''m</i> moving.  Kudos - super nice job.</td>', 'Huge impact shot here.  The sense of motion through the frame is really well done!  I''m looking at it and feeling like I''m moving.  Kudos - super nice job.', '2006-11-10 08:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
