(3020339, 421643, 67006, '<td valign="top">I''m a beginner and would love to know more about how you made this immage.  CW?  Do tell!</td>', 'I''m a beginner and would love to know more about how you made this immage.  CW?  Do tell!', '2006-11-10 14:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
