(3020342, 423260, 67006, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  I''m a beginner, so please share....Did you move the camera or the "Open"?</td>', 'I really like this photo.  I''m a beginner, so please share....Did you move the camera or the "Open"?', '2006-11-10 14:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
