(3023768, 421505, 32147, '<td valign="top">wow.  great idea and good composition.  While I wish there was a little less grain to it, I imagine that it would be near impossible to pull this off with no grain present.  <br/> <br/>I really like how you captured the beam of light; even the angle of the beam seems correct - and I like how you can make out Orion in the sky.  well done.</td>', 'wow.  great idea and good composition.  While I wish there was a little less grain to it, I imagine that it would be near impossible to pull this off with no grain present.   I really like how you captured the beam of light; even the angle of the beam seems correct - and I like how you can make out Orion in the sky.  well done.', '2006-11-12 12:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3023770, 423372, 32147, '<td valign="top">interesting shot - well thought out and great composition.</td>', 'interesting shot - well thought out and great composition.', '2006-11-12 12:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
