(3025320, 421766, 37818, '<td valign="top">OK, just about died laughing at your comments, and still think you must be the kewlest immunologist in Washington :)<br/> <br/>Totally Ripped oFf! at least 6.4795 in my books!</td>', 'OK, just about died laughing at your comments, and still think you must be the kewlest immunologist in Washington :) Totally Ripped oFf! at least 6.4795 in my books!', '2006-11-13 02:07:52.000000', NULL, 0),
