(3025353, 421771, 61448, '<td valign="top">As nicely done as this is... it is not wind... it is water. Who the heck votes on these things? Are they friends and such? Are they voting on a purely, "Purdy things" scale?????? It is a whirlpool... W-A-T-E-R...<br/> <br/>Sorry if I took a bit of shine off your ribbon... but are the voters actually thinking? The challenge was wind. You submitted a water shot...  Maybe I just don''t get it.<br/>And yes, wirlpool does have an "h" in it...<br/> <br/>I just don''t get it....<br/> <br/>Wind... water..... maybe ya could have won first place with a fire pic...<br/> <br/>I just don''t get it...</td>', 'As nicely done as this is... it is not wind... it is water. Who the heck votes on these things? Are they friends and such? Are they voting on a purely, "Purdy things" scale?????? It is a whirlpool... W-A-T-E-R... Sorry if I took a bit of shine off your ribbon... but are the voters actually thinking? The challenge was wind. You submitted a water shot...  Maybe I just don''t get it.And yes, wirlpool does have an "h" in it... I just don''t get it.... Wind... water..... maybe ya could have won first place with a fire pic... I just don''t get it...', '2006-11-13 02:28:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3025363, 421771, 25793, '<td valign="top">Well this was the "Long Exposure II" Challenge and not the "Wind" Challenge.  Sorry if your upset that the voters voted correctly and you are the one who missunderstood.</td>', 'Well this was the "Long Exposure II" Challenge and not the "Wind" Challenge.  Sorry if your upset that the voters voted correctly and you are the one who missunderstood.', '2006-11-13 02:40:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3025370, 421771, 67892, '<td valign="top">Such a great shot. well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'Such a great shot. well deserved ribbon!', '2006-11-13 02:46:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3025372, 422972, 16004, '<td valign="top">these are actually fireworks.  no, really.  it was the end result of an accidental capture (no actual post photo cropping involved).  i liked it.  figured it would be as well received as a puppy poo in a boot, but i thought, what the hell.</td>', 'these are actually fireworks.  no, really.  it was the end result of an accidental capture (no actual post photo cropping involved).  i liked it.  figured it would be as well received as a puppy poo in a boot, but i thought, what the hell.', '2006-11-13 02:48:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3025373, 423110, 20462, '<td valign="top">i think this is quite good.  The background of the lake shore, I''d remove it for your own pleasure, and make a natural fade from water to sky... that would top it off.</td>', 'i think this is quite good.  The background of the lake shore, I''d remove it for your own pleasure, and make a natural fade from water to sky... that would top it off.', '2006-11-13 02:49:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3025382, 421771, 61448, '<td valign="top">Um..... never mind... I was mistaken. I thought I had clicked on the "Wind" challenge... (I prolly should not drink before commenting) I apologize for any comment that was inapropriate (and in retrospect... it seems all of them were)  as a long exposure it was just fine for the challenge... as wind it was not. But it was not entered in wind....<br/> <br/>move along... nowt more to read here<br/> <br/></td>', 'Um..... never mind... I was mistaken. I thought I had clicked on the "Wind" challenge... (I prolly should not drink before commenting) I apologize for any comment that was inapropriate (and in retrospect... it seems all of them were)  as a long exposure it was just fine for the challenge... as wind it was not. But it was not entered in wind.... move along... nowt more to read here ', '2006-11-13 02:55:18.000000', NULL, 0),
