(3025597, 423049, 55838, '<td valign="top">Oooo ahhhh.  I loved this image during the challenge and am surprised it didn''t receive a 6 score. I find the variety of colors - especially on the right - and the confetti sprinkling of white lights on the left particularly attractive.  Very well done.</td>', 'Oooo ahhhh.  I loved this image during the challenge and am surprised it didn''t receive a 6 score. I find the variety of colors - especially on the right - and the confetti sprinkling of white lights on the left particularly attractive.  Very well done.', '2006-11-13 05:24:19.000000', NULL, 0),
