(3025661, 422718, 48954, '<td valign="top">what did you use to make the "fire"? PM...let me know cause this is a vry cool shot! Only 50th? Should have bone better I think.</td>', 'what did you use to make the "fire"? PM...let me know cause this is a vry cool shot! Only 50th? Should have bone better I think.', '2006-11-13 06:27:46.000000', NULL, 0),
