(3025666, 422006, 27482, '<td valign="top">Great shot buddy, nice way to start off the WPL3 season!  Go 5D!  Don´t quite get using 400iso and f22, I would have used iso 100 and f8 for better image quality but what the heck do I know... :P  Congrats!</td>', 'Great shot buddy, nice way to start off the WPL3 season!  Go 5D!  Don´t quite get using 400iso and f22, I would have used iso 100 and f8 for better image quality but what the heck do I know... :P  Congrats!', '2006-11-13 06:31:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3025667, 421705, 27482, '<td valign="top">Darn it, so close.  Those 7+ scores and no ribbons SUCK, I think I have about seven or eight 7+ that didn´t ribbon so I know the feeling... :P  Anyway, great shot and great score for the team!</td>', 'Darn it, so close.  Those 7+ scores and no ribbons SUCK, I think I have about seven or eight 7+ that didn´t ribbon so I know the feeling... :P  Anyway, great shot and great score for the team!', '2006-11-13 06:31:57.000000', NULL, 0),
