(3025724, 422623, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like I-35 here, too.  Cept we don''t have "Love''s".  I like shots like these - I like the light trails and the blinker is cool.  Take this into PS and hit it with a dose of "sharpen" and see what you think.  (With the 10D you have to sharpen a lot more than you did with the Gateway.)</td>', 'Looks like I-35 here, too.  Cept we don''t have "Love''s".  I like shots like these - I like the light trails and the blinker is cool.  Take this into PS and hit it with a dose of "sharpen" and see what you think.  (With the 10D you have to sharpen a lot more than you did with the Gateway.)', '2006-11-13 07:02:06.000000', NULL, 0),
