(3029167, 422006, 15811, '<td valign="top">Oh wow...sweet photo.  I love it.  Saturation is perfect, exposure is perfect.  You definately deserved the ribbon.</td>', 'Oh wow...sweet photo.  I love it.  Saturation is perfect, exposure is perfect.  You definately deserved the ribbon.', '2006-11-14 02:36:13.000000', NULL, 0),
