(3029563, 423324, 20941, '<td valign="top">Awesome Nick! My husband John JUST was saying I should try a shot from the overpass there and then your shot popped up! Building a store by Manhattan Beach so this will soon be by view Heading Home everyday! Well done... ribbons comong soon for you!</td>', 'Awesome Nick! My husband John JUST was saying I should try a shot from the overpass there and then your shot popped up! Building a store by Manhattan Beach so this will soon be by view Heading Home everyday! Well done... ribbons comong soon for you!', '2006-11-14 08:14:44.000000', NULL, 0),
