(3030582, 423206, 811, '<td valign="top">I imagine the bright bright centers of the light were a turn off for some people.  Something that may have helped to keep from overexposing them, but still getting your colors would be to expose the green, cover the lens until it went yellow, expose for yellow, then cover until it goes red, etc.  I don''t know about the little hand light.  Part of me likes it becuase it gives soemthing else in the frame to see, and part of me is distracted  with it for exactly the same reason.  <br/> <br/>Neat idea, though.  definitely creative.</td>', 'I imagine the bright bright centers of the light were a turn off for some people.  Something that may have helped to keep from overexposing them, but still getting your colors would be to expose the green, cover the lens until it went yellow, expose for yellow, then cover until it goes red, etc.  I don''t know about the little hand light.  Part of me likes it becuase it gives soemthing else in the frame to see, and part of me is distracted  with it for exactly the same reason.   Neat idea, though.  definitely creative.', '2006-11-14 13:51:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3030585, 423110, 811, '<td valign="top">Three years!  dang, girlfriend, you gotta work on that. :)  Though I understand completely.  My husband and I have had one night in, oh, 3 or 4 years, I think . ..<br/> <br/>Anyway, I love the colors and composition in this shot.  You did well, and this is a cool idea.  &lt;karmat files idea of spinning umbrella away for future reference . . .&gt;<br/> <br/>Great work!</td>', 'Three years!  dang, girlfriend, you gotta work on that. :)  Though I understand completely.  My husband and I have had one night in, oh, 3 or 4 years, I think . .. Anyway, I love the colors and composition in this shot.  You did well, and this is a cool idea.  <karmat files idea of spinning umbrella away for future reference . . .> Great work!', '2006-11-14 13:53:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3030592, 423049, 811, '<td valign="top">Having totally screwed up trying to shoot fireworks the past couple of attempts, you are my hero.  :)  Great colors and *focus*.  I like the movement in them.</td>', 'Having totally screwed up trying to shoot fireworks the past couple of attempts, you are my hero.  :)  Great colors and *focus*.  I like the movement in them.', '2006-11-14 13:55:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3030594, 423148, 811, '<td valign="top">Yea, another hero -- ''cause i screw fireworks pics up so badly.  Mangle them even.  Great work.  I like the trees in the foreground because it gives a setting or context to the shot.  Nice work!!!</td>', 'Yea, another hero -- ''cause i screw fireworks pics up so badly.  Mangle them even.  Great work.  I like the trees in the foreground because it gives a setting or context to the shot.  Nice work!!!', '2006-11-14 13:55:58.000000', NULL, 0),
