(3031003, 423294, 51391, '<td valign="top">I used to live in Monterey, and I have to say, you have captured the Lone Cypress in quite a magical photo!  Awesome!!!!</td>', 'I used to live in Monterey, and I have to say, you have captured the Lone Cypress in quite a magical photo!  Awesome!!!!', '2006-11-14 16:33:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3031103, 421771, 25793, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe:</b></div><hr/><i> super - congrats.  curious why the crop.<br/>j </i></td></tr></table>  I cropped it because of the distracting reflection of the sky at the very bottom.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by talmy:</b></div><hr/><i> But aren''t those swirling fish? Great idea to feature them by going with a very long exposure, "longer than normal". With a typical 1 second exposure I always found them a distracting blur.  </i></td></tr></table>   The swirl is not the fish.  It is a lot of fallen leaves that got trapped in the current.  The exposure was set for 30 seconds.  I accomplished the exposure by stacking a circular polarizer with a 3 stop neutral density filter and shooting at f14 at ISO 100.  The shot was taken at about 9:30 in the morning.</td>', 'Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe: super - congrats.  curious why the crop.j   I cropped it because of the distracting reflection of the sky at the very bottom. Originally posted by talmy: But aren''t those swirling fish? Great idea to feature them by going with a very long exposure, "longer than normal". With a typical 1 second exposure I always found them a distracting blur.     The swirl is not the fish.  It is a lot of fallen leaves that got trapped in the current.  The exposure was set for 30 seconds.  I accomplished the exposure by stacking a circular polarizer with a 3 stop neutral density filter and shooting at f14 at ISO 100.  The shot was taken at about 9:30 in the morning.', '2006-11-14 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3031866, 423292, 42567, '<td valign="top">Judi!! WOW..love the purple this picture gives!  Great job</td>', 'Judi!! WOW..love the purple this picture gives!  Great job', '2006-11-14 21:50:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3031909, 423236, 42567, '<td valign="top">one comment!  Come on people...<br/> <br/>Waz, I don''t think I could ever juggle fire!  I think this is a great long exposure.  Maybe a better background would give the voters more to look at and you more points.  Just my thought. <br/> <br/>Keep up the great work!<br/> <br/>Phillip<br/> <br/></td>', 'one comment!  Come on people... Waz, I don''t think I could ever juggle fire!  I think this is a great long exposure.  Maybe a better background would give the voters more to look at and you more points.  Just my thought.  Keep up the great work! Phillip ', '2006-11-14 22:05:26.000000', NULL, 0),
