(3032599, 423110, 31399, '<td valign="top">folks DO use umbrellas when it''s not raining! UV protection..lol<br/> <br/>This shot really makes me chuckle and is very emotive to me:<br/>1.  YEAH on church camp!!!!!!! God''s always a good thing<br/>2.  Send the kiddies my way...you guys need sitter!<br/>3.  giggles and smiles at thought of him spinning umbrella and you laughing as you BOTH count seconds left in exposure...lol hopefully looking/being with you he forgot to keep spinning at some point :-)<br/> <br/>lovely image!</td>', 'folks DO use umbrellas when it''s not raining! UV protection..lol This shot really makes me chuckle and is very emotive to me:1.  YEAH on church camp!!!!!!! God''s always a good thing2.  Send the kiddies my way...you guys need sitter!3.  giggles and smiles at thought of him spinning umbrella and you laughing as you BOTH count seconds left in exposure...lol hopefully looking/being with you he forgot to keep spinning at some point :-) lovely image!', '2006-11-15 00:34:00.000000', NULL, 0),
