(3035634, 423372, 55838, '<td valign="top">Cool shot - good idea and I like the shapes in the green.  I haven''t tried "painting" yet...one of these days!  Maybe would have scored higher if the focus on the crayon was sharper and if more of the light were brighter.  Who knows...5.0 seems a bit harsh for this image IMO.</td>', 'Cool shot - good idea and I like the shapes in the green.  I haven''t tried "painting" yet...one of these days!  Maybe would have scored higher if the focus on the crayon was sharper and if more of the light were brighter.  Who knows...5.0 seems a bit harsh for this image IMO.', '2006-11-15 20:05:44.000000', NULL, 0),
