(3036600, 422084, 22537, '<td valign="top">Though I like the shot....and I like waterfall shots, this is ....ummm....boring???  Are you relyiong too much on the waterfall as your subject?  If so, it should not be a consequence of the rule of thirds but rather a fundamental focal point within the composition.</td>', 'Though I like the shot....and I like waterfall shots, this is ....ummm....boring???  Are you relyiong too much on the waterfall as your subject?  If so, it should not be a consequence of the rule of thirds but rather a fundamental focal point within the composition.', '2006-11-16 02:32:17.000000', NULL, 0),
