(3036890, 423099, 47906, '<td valign="top">I like the sharpness of the tones and the contrasts in the photo, The extended time on the water makes it very nice and the shadows add to a very storng overall photo. If you had a bit of sunset/sunrise color this would be a show stopper.<br/> <br/>Rich</td>', 'I like the sharpness of the tones and the contrasts in the photo, The extended time on the water makes it very nice and the shadows add to a very storng overall photo. If you had a bit of sunset/sunrise color this would be a show stopper. Rich', '2006-11-16 07:15:47.000000', NULL, 0),
